<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>断了能接着聊，不用从头再问一遍</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>这是第一个「会出岔子的时刻」：中途关掉、网络断了，回来还在不在</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 560, height: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>打个比方</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 10 }}>打游戏都懂：存档、读档</Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: 520, height: 120, marginTop: 22 }}>
      <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 52, width: 520, height: 10, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 5 }} />
      <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 150, top: 45, width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
      <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 340, top: 45, width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
      <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 108, top: 16, fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>存档点一</Text>
      <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 298, top: 16, fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>存档点二</Text>
      <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 80, fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>开始</Text>
      <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 470, top: 80, fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>继续</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 6 }}>
      每走完一步，它把「走到哪了」记一笔。你关掉页面、网断了，下次打开从这个点接着走，不用把前面重讲一遍。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 190, width: 504, height: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>它是怎么做的</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 108, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 12 }}>一、你说一句</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          它先判断这句话要干什么——是问知识点、要出题，还是让你查资料。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 108, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 12 }}>二、它自己决定下一步</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          查什么、调哪个工具，是它自己选的；每选一次，就把进展存一次档。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 108, borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 12 }}>三、要动你的数据，先停下</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          存笔记、记错题这类操作，会停在那里等你点确认——这也是「存档」带来的能力。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 586, width: 1128, height: 50, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      工程上叫：回合状态图 · 检查点（断点）· 中断后恢复（interrupt / resume）
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>03 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
